# Beyond Infinity (jeuno 137): state 4, accepted with Prog 0 and no Soul Gem Clasp (the battlefield lost: the clasp is
# worn on entry; here a GM drops it). A level 91 Warrior at level cap 95, Prelude to Puissance completed, the Limit
# Breaker held, Beyond Infinity accepted (a GM), MAX_LEVEL 99, 0 merit points. The moogle: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 3, 0, 0,
# meritCost) with meritCost 0 at 0 merit points and 1 from 1; its update option 9 takes one merit point when there is
# one (nothing at 0), any other update option nothing; its finish: option 0 nothing, any other the clasp, and 17 / 25 /
# 26 / 27 set down at Horlais Peak / Waughroon Shrine / Balga's Dais / Qu'Bia Arena (1: the clasp only). The trade: four
# crests, six, five with a flint stone, a flint stone alone: not exact: nil; five alone: 10195 (1), whose finish takes
# them and gives the clasp whatever the option, and 16 / 22 / 23 / 24 set down at the four arenas (0: no set-down).
# Each set-down zones at the next tick; a GM warp brings the char back and drops the clasp again. Last, Prog 2 (a GM):
# none of the states (Prog 0 / 1): the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventUpdate/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10195
